    "content": "<div class=\"ml-en\"><span class=\"eyebrow\">TPG302 · Assessment 3/5</span>\n<h2>Practice 1</h2>\n<p class=\"nhan\">Source: FLM syllabus 13667 · assessment table (verbatim)</p></div>\n<div class=\"ml-vi\"><span class=\"eyebrow\">TPG302 · Đầu điểm 3/5</span>\n<h2>Practice 1</h2>\n<p class=\"nhan\">Nguồn: syllabus FLM 13667 · bảng đánh giá (nguyên văn)</p></div>\n<div class=\"kv-grid\">\n  <div class=\"kv\"><span class=\"k\">Type / Loại</span><span class=\"v\">on-going</span></div>\n  <div class=\"kv\"><span class=\"k\">Weight / Trọng số</span><span class=\"v\">35.0%</span></div>\n  <div class=\"kv\"><span class=\"k\">Parts / Số phần</span><span class=\"v\">1</span></div>\n  <div class=\"kv\"><span class=\"k\">Completion criteria / Điều kiện hoàn thành</span><span class=\"v\">&gt;0</span></div>\n  <div class=\"kv\"><span class=\"k\">Duration / Thời lượng</span><span class=\"v\">in class and homework</span></div>\n  <div class=\"kv\"><span class=\"k\">CLO</span><span class=\"v\">CLO1, CLO2, CLO4, CLO5</span></div>\n  <div class=\"kv\"><span class=\"k\">No. of questions / Số câu</span><span class=\"v\">1</span></div>\n  <div class=\"kv\"><span class=\"k\">Knowledge &amp; skill / Kiến thức &amp; kỹ năng</span><span class=\"v\">- Understand the fuction of different sections of a book. - Identify and explain the role of non-text elements (notes, captions, sidebars, etc).- Recognize the importance of font choices for both body text and display elements (heading, titles). - Learn basic principles of combining typefaces effectively.- Understand how to design visually appealing and functional page layouts and spreads.- Consider principles of hierarchy, balance, legibility and readability.- Gain a basic awareness of design consideration specific to books intended for printing.</span></div>\n  <div class=\"kv\"><span class=\"k\">Grading guide / Hướng dẫn chấm</span><span class=\"v\">The evaluation will consider the following criteria:<br><br>Brief &amp; content plan (10%), Type system, grid &amp; styles (20%), Core making / prototyping (30%), Integration, testing &amp; iteration (20%), Final delivery &amp; documentation (20%).</span></div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"ml-en\"><p class=\"ghi-chu\">No practice paper for this subject in the Exam Room yet.</p></div>\n<div class=\"ml-vi\"><p class=\"ghi-chu\">Phòng thi chưa có đề luyện cho môn này.</p></div>\n<div class=\"ml-en\"><div class=\"note-ct\">📝 Exam-strategy notes and worked past papers: coming later.</div></div>\n<div class=\"ml-vi\"><div class=\"note-ct\">📝 Chiến lược làm bài và chữa đề: sẽ bổ sung sau.</div></div>"
